It was hard. I could not find the alloy to work the metal of the blades. But thanks to the agreement made with the Goblins after the incident in which, affected by the Fire Soul, they attacked us, we got the Goblin Cobalt Ore.
That let me create the Perfect Goblin Cobalt and use it as an alloy to work the molten metal of the Purified Blades.

I finished the Magic Censer. It can withstand the heat needed to burn the Faugn samples.
Please, deliver it to Celina.

[Challenge Objective]

Take the Magic Censer to Sage Celina in Pillai.
